{"overview":"چگونه با مادرتان آشنا شدم (آشنایی با مادر) سریال کمدی موقعیت محصول شبکه CBS است که از ۲۸ شهریور ۱۳۸۴، تا ۱۱ فروردین ۱۳۹۳ از آن شبکه پخش شده است. این سریال داستان شخصیت اصلی، تد موزبی و دوستان او را در منهتن را دنبال می کند. تد در سال 2030 برای دختر و پسر خود رویداد هایی که منجر به آشنایی با مادرشان آشنا شود را بازگو می کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A father recounts to his children - through a series of flashbacks - the journey he and his four best friends took leading up to him meeting their mother.","tagline_en":"A love story in reverse.","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":10,"y":2006,"poster":"/fm1PgrpoBRlhCrHV9od4nLZIs8t.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":22,"y":2005,"poster":"/7n8OEMRgIVkyPfswdBaftEBqQnI.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":22,"y":2006,"poster":"/8OEKsU865P88LrAO6dZ157VNvHV.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":20,"y":2007,"poster":"/4QwuGNHzByZxXftS01EMbks7Cn7.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":24,"y":2008,"poster":"/8Ly76CWFpQ6voKvUZmOKsBwF6qH.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":24,"y":2009,"poster":"/hNwfnZpuiTfSRCEJz77IO3Kvib6.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":24,"y":2010,"poster":"/fKKZ5Zns5ISPoF4lwH0a14TgBxp.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":24,"y":2011,"poster":"/8tme9C6s75sj0Nn7DQrn6PlNa1B.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":24,"y":2012,"poster":"/o6BepKycT39kubElBsnj5bWpDPU.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":24,"y":2013,"poster":"/ynDSoB5ilvp2qnSJp1WFCZSRjbm.jpg"}],"episodes":208,"crew":["Craig Thomas","کارتر بیز"],"crew_en":["Craig Thomas","Carter Bays"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Josh Radnor","role":"Ted Mosby","photo":"/rHx4D70iRUkka5kl9064kOvmSQs.jpg"},{"name":"نیل پاتریک هریس","role":"Barney Stinson","photo":"/r2twLWLwDpKJ7JyhWsD1YsL7rJV.jpg","en":"Neil Patrick Harris"},{"name":"جیسون سیگل","role":"Marshall Eriksen","photo":"/aG6tVNSbl1YEjN65G3luFYnWbUM.jpg","en":"Jason Segel"},{"name":"Alyson Hannigan","role":"Lily Aldrin","photo":"/bO16z8rAzZWdjCga8dcbJ2AFAh2.jpg"},{"name":"کوبی اسمالدرز",